with a donkey jawbone.</i>

14
00:03:04.757 --> 00:03:06.893
<i>A thousand.</i>

15
00:03:10.831 --> 00:03:14.901
<i>Pushed a temple over
after his eyes were put out.</i>

16
00:03:17.671 --> 00:03:20.608
<i>'Course Samson
was the lucky one.</i>

17
00:03:21.941 --> 00:03:25.677
<i>In the end, he didn't have to
see the monster he became.</i>

18
00:03:32.852 --> 00:03:35.052
<i>A man can only see
so much darkness</i>

19
